From 5b20ad129733158bbd30a1911ff61b18800dbf2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jordan Williams Johnson <jordandwj@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 05:17:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 08/11] etnaviv/ml: Don't accept subtractions on V7

etna_ml_operation_supported() accepts SUBTRACT on every NN core version,
but only etna_ml_lower_add_v8() can lower it. On V7 the operation reaches
etna_ml_lower_add_v7(), which asserts that it got an ADD; without
assertions it would be compiled as an addition.

Report subtractions as unsupported on V7 so they stay on the CPU.

Found with test_teflon on a VIPNano-QI.7120 (Amlogic A311D):
teflon/movenet_lightning.0095 and .0136 (and the same two of
movenet_thunder) are single subtractions and aborted on the assertion,
as did the two whole-model tests.

Generated-by: LLM
---
 src/gallium/drivers/etnaviv/etnaviv_ml.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/gallium/drivers/etnaviv/etnaviv_ml.c b/src/gallium/drivers/etnaviv/etnaviv_ml.c
index 19860905f9f7..393a5ea9900e 100644
--- a/src/gallium/drivers/etnaviv/etnaviv_ml.c
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/etnaviv/etnaviv_ml.c
@@ -721,6 +721,12 @@ etna_ml_operation_supported(struct pipe_ml_device *pdevice,
       case PIPE_ML_OPERATION_TYPE_ADD: {
          supported = operation->input_tensors[0]->data == NULL &&
                      operation->input_tensors[1]->data == NULL;
+
+         /* Only V8 has a lowering for subtractions */
+         if (operation->type == PIPE_ML_OPERATION_TYPE_SUBTRACT &&
+             etna_ml_device_screen(pdevice)->specs.nn_core_version < 8)
+            supported = false;
+
          break;
       }
       case PIPE_ML_OPERATION_TYPE_CONCATENATION: {
